tier         showcase;
description  "Green ammonia, 1200 t/day, at the FEASIBILITY stage with a 50 bar synthesis loop: the speculation of a catalyst that would approach equilibrium at 400 C and 50 bar. One make-up compression stage from the electrolyser's 30 bar, a Gibbs converter 5 K short of equilibrium, separation at 47 bar and -20 C; duties served by catalogue utilities, pinch targets, and the gross margin, to be read against the 150 bar case. An equilibrium model says what such a plant would earn, not that such a catalyst exists.";
